  "notes" : [
    {
      "framed" : true,
      "id" : "E5C71D66-EFA8-4075-AA8D-93B979BE1EA0",
      "size" : 12,
      "text" : "Nixie seconds clock\n\nG1 32.768 kHz / 16384 (U1) / 2 (U2) = 1 Hz.\nU3 counts units 0-9; its QD clocks U5, which counts tens\n0-5 (QB and QC reset it at 6). Each 74141 (U4, U6) pulls\none cathode of its IN-14 low: DS1 units, DS2 tens.\n\nP1: 1 = +5 V, 2 = +170 V, 3 = GND.\nR1, R2: 10 k anode resistors (about 2.5 mA).",
      "x" : 80,
      "y" : -220
    }
  ],
